Requirements:
- Act on exactly 7 data qubits, indexed 0..6, starting from |0⟩^{⊗ 7}.
- The final quantum state on the data qubits must be a +1 eigenstate of every provided stabilizer generator.
- You may use additional ancilla qubits if helpful (index them starting at 7 and above).
